        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The health passport gives concrete form to the patient's care project. It constitutes a tool for sharing information between the community and hospital centred on and kept by the patient. It favours coordination between the different professionals involved in the care of patients with heart failure. Given to all patients from the beginning of their treatment, this personalised care programme enables the proposed treatment to be formalised."
